.PP
The Linux, macOS (.dmg) and stripped builds of v3.6.6 give identical
files. Earlier versions embed fewer of them; the four LA1016 and LA2016
bitstreams and kingst-la-01a2.fw are the same since v3.5.0.
.PP
Copy the above firmware and bitstream files to the location where libsigrok
expects to find firmware files. By default this is
.BR /usr/local/share/sigrok-firmware .
.SH OPTIONS
None.
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
Exits with 0 on success, 1 on most failures.
